2450c2bf0ad4"],

Cell["\<\
Just like in Calculus II you need to translate every y into u. \
\>", "Subsubitem",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9694382350763636`*^9, 3.9694382712429624`*^9}, {
   3.9694383134770784`*^9, 3.9694383318675656`*^9}, {3.969438474361555*^9, 
   3.9694384969314632`*^9}, {3.969438640535979*^9, 3.9694386683988333`*^9}, {
   3.969438708561661*^9, 3.9694387392510185`*^9}, {3.969438772204322*^9, 
   3.9694391279316015`*^9}, {3.969439288434181*^9, 3.969439288434181*^9}, {
